      "statement": "All three APIs list the Fraud Risk Signals API (API-08) as an upstream source. API-03 and API-04 check funds via the Accounts API (API-01) and API-04 also uses Customer Identity & KYC (API-07). API-05 instead depends on FX Rates (API-13), and API-03 and API-05 also list sanctions screening upstream.",
