      "id": "claim_4ba710c683e9421ebbe0899c7c7f7238",
      "statement": "Downstream, API-03 and API-04 feed the Webhooks & Event Notifications API (API-18), but API-05's lineage does not list API-18. API-04 feeds Treasury Liquidity Positions (API-15) intraday cash and API-05 lists API-15 and the general ledger downstream, along with Fedwire and SWIFT. API-03 lists the ACH operator and general ledger.",
